    "content": "🚨 I'm hiring a Head of Business Growth Advisers (G6) 🚨\nThis is a standout opportunity to lead a major national transformation in how UK SMEs access export support—right at the heart of the UK’s growth mission.\nYou’ll shape a digital-first, data-driven advisory service, lead a network of ~70 colleagues across the UK, and work closely with ministers, senior leaders and partners to deliver real impact for businesses.\nIf you’re a strategic leader who thrives in complexity, loves driving change, and can turn big ambition into delivery, we want to hear from you.\n📍 Based in one of DBT’s UK hubs\n📅 Don’t miss the closing date 14 June\n👉 Apply and help us redefine how we support businesses to grow and export.",
